 break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Collaboration between universities and industry partners is a bridge to provide knowledge to students through a study visit at that industry partner and through the transfer of the latest technology to each other. <span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">Recognizing the importance of engaging with industry partners, CamTech University had 40 students go on a study visit to the headquarters of Chip Mong Bank, a university&#8217;s industrial partner, on August 3, 2022. <\/span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">The visit provided students with an in-depth understanding of the experience of starting a business, company structuring, and the company&#8217;s use latest technology, as well as internship opportunities for the students. <\/span><span style=\"font-family: inherit; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0em;\">CamTech University would like to thank the management of Chipmong Group for allowing the students to participate in this useful visit. The university will continue to visit other industry partners in the future.<\/span><\/div><\/div><div class=\"l7ghb35v kjdc1dyq kmwttqpk gh25dzvf jikcssrz n3t5jt4f\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0.5em 0px 0px;\"><br><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1b7a60c3 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-gap-beside-yes elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-column-vertical-align-stretch\" data-id=\"1b7a60c3\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-g